GNU Affero General Public License version 3.0. See LICENSE.

This repository includes derived code, structure, pipeline guidance, tests, and
ideas from the OpenMontage project located at C:\OpenMontage in the development
environment. OpenMontage is treated as an AGPL-3.0 source project for Montara's
porting/provenance purposes.

Montara-specific additions include, among other work:

- the editable Timeline IR boundary and editor export surfaces;
- TypeScript verification and validation gates;
- Montara CLI and render/export bridge behavior;
- generalized documentary evidence craft;
- content-aware reel planning;
- runtime-honesty and provider-audit documentation;
- Playwright authenticated browser capture workflow;
- Layer 2 Montara skills and Layer 3 skill wiring;
- CI for typecheck, verify, validate, and pytest.

Montara invokes local vision runtimes rather than bundling them. Robust Video
Matting (GPL-3.0), SAM 2 (Apache-2.0), and Ultralytics YOLO (AGPL-3.0) are
installed and run outside this repository, and their model weights carry their
own licences. Ultralytics in particular requires a commercial licence from
Ultralytics for commercial use.

Attribution and dependency notes are maintained in docs/ATTRIBUTION.md.

